+> docker run -v "$(pwd):/code" -w /code sokrates init
+
+### Landscape report
+
+The landscape report aggregates the analyses of multiple repositories found under an analysis root:
+
+> java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -analysisRoot <folder>
+
+* `analyzeLandscape` creates or updates the landscape report in `<folder>/_sokrates_landscape/` (the `index.html` report and its `config.json`). It is the landscape counterpart of the analysis commands.
+* `updateLandscape` is the same command under its older name, kept so existing scripts keep working. Both accept the same options (`-analysisRoot`, `-recursive`, `-confFile`, `-setName`, `-setDescription`, `-setLogoLink`, `-addLink`, `-date`, `-timeout`).
+* Run `java -jar sokrates.jar analyzeLandscape -help` for the full list of options.
\ No newline at end of file
